The functions concerned are get_dz, read_acquisition and seriesData_to_arrayData
in aorta-mesh-morphing/suport_mri.py, which carries the full MIT licence text and
the copyright notice. The first is identical to flow4D's, the second differs in
detail, the third has been substantially reworked. The remainder of that file is
the authors' own and has no counterpart in flow4D.

